# Binary files are never text-converted.
#
# docs/Fao56.pdf was committed corrupt: something copied it through a text
# encoding, every non-ASCII byte became EF BF BD (the UTF-8 replacement
# character), and the 6.4 MB book grew to 11.3 MB that no PDF reader can open.
# With core.autocrlf=true on this repo, marking these explicitly is what stops
# git itself from ever being that something.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
